What’s new
Get ready for the all-new KWSP i-Akaun app, designed to provide you with a seamless and user-friendly experience. While our current i-Akaun app has served us well, we would like to introduce our members to the new KWSP i-Akaun app. This upgraded platform provides a range of tools to support you in optimising your retirement savings. Easily access and utilise your favourite features from the current i-Akaun version, now with added convenience. Stay in control of your retirement savings effortlessly, making the most of these features at your fingertips:

•            Register as an EPF member and activate your i-Akaun instantly;
•            Boost your savings with Voluntary Contribution;
•            View and download Accounts statements, check on contributions and more; 
•            Plan for your golden years with our new retirement calculator; 
•            Protect yourself with affordable healthcare insurance/takaful;
•            Check your withdrawal eligibility, apply for withdrawals and view your past withdrawal transactions for members aged 50 years and above; and 
•            Get important updates and tips from EPF, so you can stay informed about the latest opportunities to maximise your savings. 
 
From monitoring your account activities and taking charge of your retirement savings to locating our nearest branch, everything is on the app, at your fingertips.  
  
So why wait? Download the new KWSP i-Akaun app now and start maximising your savings potential with ease and confidence! 
We would like to inform our valued members that the current i-Akaun app will be phased out and ultimately discontinued.
